sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant U as ProcessUserMessageUseCase
    participant F as FactExtractionPort
    participant V as ContractValidator
    participant P as ConversationParser
    participant M as ConversationMerger
    participant A as ConversationAssessment
    participant C as Conversation
    participant W as ConversationUnitOfWork
    participant E as EventPublisher

    User->>U: execute(message, processContext)
    activate U

    Note over U: Step 1: LoadConversationStep
    U->>W: getStore().findById()
    W-->>U: conversation

    Note over U: Step 2: IdempotencyStep
    U->>W: getIdempotencyStore().isProcessed()
    W-->>U: false

    Note over U: Step 3: FactExtractionStep
    U->>F: extractFacts(message)
    activate F
    F-->>U: { schemaVersion, payload }
    deactivate F
    
    Note over U: Step 4: ValidationStep
    U->>V: parse(payload)
    V-->>U: AiOutput (Valid Contract)

    Note over U: Step 5: ParsingStep
    U->>P: map(AiOutput, schemaVersion)
    P-->>U: parsedFacts

    Note over U: Step 6: MergeFactsStep
    U->>M: merge(existingFacts, parsedFacts)
    M-->>U: MergeResult { facts, changes, hasChanges }

    Note over U: Step 7: AssessmentStep
    U->>A: assess(mergedFacts)
    A-->>U: assessmentSnapshot

    Note over U: Step 8: ApplyFactsStep
    U->>C: applyFacts(mergedFacts, assessmentSnapshot)
    C-->>U: ok

    Note over U: Step 9: PersistStep (UoW)
    U->>W: execute(transaction)
    activate W
    Note over W: save conversation
    Note over W: mark processed
    W-->>U: transaction committed
    deactivate W

    Note over U: Step 10: PublishEventsStep
    U->>C: releaseEvents()
    C-->>U: domainEvents
    U->>E: publish(domainEvents)

    Note over U: Step 11: ResponseMappingStep
    U-->>User: ProcessUserMessageResponse
    deactivate U
